<title>FRANCE: Ford sees Mazda breakeven this year.</title>
<headline>Ford sees Mazda breakeven this year.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ford Motor Co chairman Alex Trotman said on Monday that he expected Mazda to break even during the current fiscal year.</p>
</text>
